traitModelLoader），具体用法见其项目文档。","desc":""},{"id":"140","title":"WanVideoModelLoader","type":"WanVideoModelLoader","cat":"load","x":-200,"y":-1410,"inputs":[{"name":"fantasyportrait_model","type":"FANTASYPORTRAITMODEL"}],"outputs":[{"name":"model","type":"WANVIDEOMODEL"}],"widgets":["wan/Wan2_1-I2V-14B-720p_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.…","fp16_fast","disabled","main_device","sageattn"],"brief":"加载 14B 主模型，挂 sageattn、fp8 与配料 LoRA 链","desc":""},{"id":"187","title":"⏸ WanVideoTorchCompileSettings","type":"WanVideoTorchCompileSettings","cat":"video","x":-180,"y":-1680,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"torch_compile_args","type":"WANCOMPILEARGS"}],"widgets":["inductor","false","default","false","64","false","128"],"brief":"默认旁路的编译加速支线，追求速度可启用","desc":""}],"links":[{"from":"138","fromOut":0,"to":"140","toIn":7},{"from":"138","fromOut":0,"to":"142","toIn":0},{"from":"151","fromOut":0,"to":"150","toIn":0},{"from":"142","fromOut":0,"to":"150","toIn":1},{"from":"156","fromOut":0,"to":"149","toIn":0},{"from":"157","fromOut":0,"to":"156","toIn":1},{"from":"159","fromOut":0,"to":"158","toIn":0},{"from":"160","fromOut":0,"to":"145","toIn":0},{"from":"149","fromOut":0,"to":"162","toIn":1},{"from":"145","fromOut":0,"to":"142","toIn":1},{"from":"145","fromOut":0,"to":"164","toIn":0},{"from":"158","fromOut":0,"to":"151","toIn":1},{"from":"140","fromOut":0,"to":"165","toIn":0},{"from":"165","fromOut":0,"to":"156","toIn":0},{"from":"154","fromOut":0,"to":"165","toIn":1},{"from":"152","fromOut":0,"to":"166","toIn":0},{"from":"167","fromOut":0,"to":"162","toIn":0},{"from":"168","fromOut":0,"to":"151","toIn":0},{"from":"169","fromOut":0,"to":"172","toIn":0},{"from":"170","fromOut":0,"to":"173","toIn":0},{"from":"174","fromOut":0,"to":"175","toIn":0},{"from":"180","fromOut":0,"to":"145","toIn":2},{"from":"181","fromOut":0,"to":"145","toIn":3},{"from":"143","fromOut":0,"to":"182","toIn":0},{"from":"145","fromOut":1,"to":"182","toIn":2},{"from":"145","fromOut":2,"to":"182","toIn":3},{"from":"182","fromOut":1,"to":"151","toIn":8},{"from":"182","fromOut":2,"to":"151","toIn":9},{"from":"160","fromOut":1,"to":"151","toIn":10},{"from":"176","fromOut":0,"to":"160","toIn":2},{"from":"182","fromOut":0,"to":"158","toIn":1},{"from":"182","fromOut":0,"to":"151","toIn":2},{"from":"182","fromOut":0,"to":"164","toIn":1},{"from":"164","fromOut":0,"to":"189","toIn":0},{"from":"162","fromOut":0,"to":"189","toIn":1},{"from":"189","fromOut":0,"to":"163","toIn":0},{"from":"150","fromOut":0,"to":"149","toIn":1},{"from":"155","fromOut":0,"to":"149","toIn":2}],"ai":{"s":"Wan2.1 14B FantasyPortrait 表演驱动工作流：一张肖像加一段驱动视频，让画中人复刻视频里的表情与动作。驱动视频经 VHS 载入并截 81 帧，缩放到 720x720 后由 FantasyPortraitFaceDetector 逐帧提取身份与表情嵌入；肖像图缩放到与视频一致的宽高，一路走 CLIP Vision 编码，一路经 WanVideoImageToVideoEncode 连同 VAE 编成 I2V 起始嵌入。两路在 WanVideoAddFantasyPortrait 处合并，这一步是灵魂——'谁在动'来自首帧，'怎么动'来自驱动视频。模型侧是 14B fp8 主干加 20 层 block swap 省显存、lightx2v 蒸馏 LoRA 提速，umt5 文本编码只作辅助描述；采样 cfg 1、6 步、dpm++_sde，蒸馏下低步数即可成片。解码后用两次 ImageConcatMulti 把驱动视频、首帧与生成结果拼成对比画面，VHS_VideoCombine 导出。被旁路的 TorchCompile 设置是可选编译加速，显存富余再启用。","u":["让照片里的数字人开口表演：给一张正面肖像，配一段自己录的表情驱动视频","口播/虚拟主播视频生产：换脸不动骨骼，表情口型完全跟随驱动视频","影视预演：用真人表演视频驱动角色立绘生成动态分镜","低显存跑 Wan 14B：block swap 20 + fp8 + 6 步蒸馏 LoRA 的组合配置可参考"],"d":3,"st":[{"name":"双素材输入","desc":"载入肖像图与驱动视频，视频按 Frames 常量截取前 81 帧；素材质量直接决定表演还原度。","nodes":["143","160","174","176"]},{"name":"尺寸对齐","desc":"驱动视频缩放到 720x720，肖像再缩放到与视频一致的宽高——首帧与表演必须同画幅，嵌入才能对齐。","nodes":["169","170","172","173","180","181","145","182"]},{"name":"身份与表演编码","desc":"肖像走 CLIP Vision 与 VAE/I2V 编码构成'静态身份'，驱动视频经 FantasyPortrait 检测器变成'动态表演'嵌入，两者在 AddFantasyPortrait 合并。","nodes":["159","158","152","168","167","151","138","142","150"]},{"name":"模型装配与采样","desc":"14B fp8 主干挂 block swap 与蒸馏 LoRA，umt5 编码辅助文本；cfg 1 六步采样是蒸馏 LoRA 专属配方。","nodes":["140","154","165","157","156","155","149","187"]},{"name":"解码与对比导出","desc":"潜空间解码回视频帧，两组拼接把输入与输出并排呈现，最后 VHS 打包导出视频文件。","nodes":["162","164","189","163"]}],"p":"6 步 + cfg 1 + shift 5 依赖 lightx2v 蒸馏 LoRA，换官方模型需改回 20-30 步；帧数由 Frames 常量(81)约束视频截取，改长视频记得同步显存预算；分辨率 Width/Height 常量 720x720，改分辨率时两张图会自动跟随。","n":"需从 Kijai 的 HuggingFace 下载 Wan2.1 I2V 14B 720p fp8、FantasyPortrait、lightx2v LoRA、umt5、clip_vision_h、Wan VAE 多个文件；14B 模型建议 16GB+ 显存，靠 block swap 20 压低占用但会变慢；驱动视频请用正面、光线稳定的人脸素材；TorchCompile 节点默认旁路，启用需 Triton 环境且首跑编译耗时。"}}